Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:52:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 106/149] nr evidence options (off by default):
 --draw_edram_dump=ORD1,ORD2,...:DIR writes the whole EDRAM (every host render
 target dumped, guest layout) after listed draw packets;
 --replay_trace_edram_dump=FILE does it at the end of a (partial) replay.
 CommandProcessor::DumpEdram (Vulkan: trace EDRAM download into a vector).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit e023a2ae3e7d21074792fff4c923e34ee51cb9d9)
